concept:human-rights-sexual-conduct-act-1994-sec-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "4 Arbitrary interferences with privacy"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-4 ;
    values:originalText "(1) Sexual conduct involving only consenting adults acting in private is not to be subject, by or under any law of the Commonwealth, a State or a Territory, to any arbitrary interference with privacy within the meaning of Article 17 of the International Covenant on Civil and Political Rights. Note: Article 17 of the International Covenant on Civil and Political Rights is set out in Schedule 2 to the Australian Human Rights Commission Act 1986.  (2) For the purposes of this section, an adult is a person who is 18 years old or more. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2009C00395  ComLaw Authoritative Act C2009C00395   Notes to the  Human Rights (Sexual Conduct) Act 1994  Table of Acts  Human Rights (Sexual Conduct) Act 1994                    3 Notes to the Human Rights (Sexual Conduct) Act Note 1 The Human Rights (Sexual Conduct) Act 1994 as shown in this compilation comprises Act No. 179, 1994 amended as indicated in the Tables below. Table of Acts Act Number and year Date of Assent Date of commencement Application, saving or transitional provisions Human Rights (Sexual Conduct) Act 1994 179, 1994" ;
    skos:definition "(1) Sexual conduct involving only consenting adults acting in private is not to be subject, by or under any law of the Commonwealth, a State or a Territory, to any arbitrary interference with privacy within the meaning of Article 17 of the International Covenant on Civil and Political Rights. Note: Article 17 of the International Covenant on Civil and Political Rights is set out in Schedule 2 to the Australian Human Rights Commission Act 1986.  (2) For the purposes of this section, an adult is a person who is 18 years old or more. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2009C00395  ComLaw Authoritative Act C2009C00395   Notes to the  Human Rights (Sexual Conduct) Act 1994  Table of Acts  Human Rights (Sexual Conduct) Act 1994                    3 Notes to the Human Rights (Sexual Conduct) Act Note 1 The Human Rights (Sexual Conduct) Act 1994 as shown in this compilation comprises Act No. 179, 1994 amended as indicated in the Tables below. Table of Acts Act Number and year Date of Assent Date of commencement Application, saving or transitional provisions Human Rights (Sexual Conduct) Act 1994 179, 1994"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "700128c3b60146a6730b3df4728bdd84208e6dc081e70382dd9a06a7f47e565c" ;
    cof:pageNumber "5"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:human-rights-sexual-conduct-act-1994-sec-4-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:human-rights-sexual-conduct-act-1994-sec-4-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <human-rights-sexual-conduct-act-1994.pdf> ;
    dc:source "human-rights-sexual-conduct-act-1994.pdf, p.5" .
